      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feeling that this void is an \"end point\" rather than a quiet space is painful, but it is the first step toward ending the self-destructive pattern you have been on for fifteen years. You do not have to \"surrender\" to find peace if surrender feels like surrendering to a mistake; sometimes the only way forward is to stop trying to build the \"weight\" you don't have and just accept the end of that specific search.",
